## Create a custom theme

Use `defineTheme` with token overrides, scale configs, and component style overrides. For the full guide — palette generation, extending themes, adaptations, custom variants, and production builds — see `npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 docs author-a-theme`.

Quick start:
```bash
npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 theme add stone   # use an existing theme
npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 theme eject stone # fork its source to customize
npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 theme build src/themes/stone/stoneTheme.ts
```

For a new coordinated color system, run `npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 theme palette generate palette.config.json --out palette.generated.ts`. Review and commit the generated palette module and receipt, import its `palette` export, then reference stable stops from semantic tokens. Regenerating an accepted palette updates every mapped token that keeps those references; generation does not rewrite the theme.

Map semantic tokens to generated palette stops:
```tsx
import {defineTheme} from '@astryxdesign/core/theme';
import {palette} from './palette.generated';

const myTheme = defineTheme({
  name: 'my-theme',
  tokens: {
    '--color-background-surface': [
      palette.neutral.light[100],
      palette.neutral.dark[15],
    ],
  },
});
```

## Icon sizes

A theme sets the dimension of each Icon size in its stylesheet: `width` and `height` on `components.icon['size:sm']` (or `xsm`, `md`, `lg`) resize that size's glyph, for semantic icon names and SVG components passed to `Icon` alike. Give the dimension in `px` or `rem`: a semantic icon takes its font size from it, so an `em` value would also grow its box. A size the theme leaves alone stays 12, 16, 20, or 24px at a 16px root (`xsm`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`) and scales with the root font size; `rem` keeps that scaling. The four size names are fixed.

Set Icon size dimensions:
```tsx
const brandTheme = defineTheme({
  name: 'brand',
  components: {
    icon: {
      'size:sm': {width: '1.125rem', height: '1.125rem'},
      'size:lg': {width: '1.75rem', height: '1.75rem'},
    },
  },
});
```

